    for(TFieldIterator<FProperty> P(MenuHost->GeneratedClass);P;++P)P->CopyCompleteValue(P->ContainerPtrToValuePtr<void>(H),P->ContainerPtrToValuePtr<void>(Before.GetStructMemory()));
